  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Satellites",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Flashin' by",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's a beautiful state we're in",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But how can we love in isolation?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Think how happy we can be when we just try",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "We're nothing like we seem",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Passionate words are never spoken",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You don't know how I bleed when I leave your side",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "In your eyes, love's alive",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You've come untied",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause we're flashin' by",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Like satellites",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Satellites",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Take all the rules away",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "How can we live if we don't change?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We're always on display",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Let's run and hide",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "In our eyes, love's alive",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "We've come untied",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause we're flashin' by",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Like satellites",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Satellites",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "bridge",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "If we don't communicate",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "We'll exist in our own space (Space)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We have all the love we need",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "While we're apart, I cannot breathe",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_6",
      "type": "outro",
